#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Labyrinth 1"
msgstr "Labirinto 1"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Teach your bot how to find its way out of the labyrinth."
msgstr "Insegna al robot a uscire dal labirinto."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Labyrinth"
msgstr "Labyrinth"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Program the bot so that it will find its way without hitting the walls of "
"the labyrinth. We suppose that you do not know the configuration of the "
"labyrinth, but there are no bifurcations, and no dead-ends. The labyrinth is"
" made of squares measuring 5m each."
msgstr ""
"Programma il robot perché trovi la strada senza urtare le pareti. Supponiamo"
" che tu non conosca il labirinto, ma non ci sono bivi né vicoli ciechi. È "
"composto da quadrati di 5 m di lato."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instruction <code>radar</code>"
msgstr "L’istruzione <code>radar</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Barrier, 0, 45, 0, 5);<n/> will "
"find any <a object|barrier>barrier</a> in front of the radar that is closer "
"than 5m. Let us take a closer look at the five parameters used:"
msgstr ""
"<c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Barrier, 0, 45, 0, 5);<n/> trova le <a "
"object|barrier>barriere</a> davanti al robot entro 5 m. Vediamo i cinque "
"parametri:"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>Barrier</code>"
msgstr "<code>Barrier</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot|category>Category</a> of the object that the radar must look for, "
"i.e. a barrier."
msgstr "<a cbot|category>Categoria</a> da cercare: una barriera."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10 ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>0</code>"
msgstr "<code>0</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Direction of the radar. <code>0</code> means that the radar must search "
"straight forward."
msgstr "Direzione del radar. <code>0</code> cerca davanti."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>45</code>"
msgstr "<code>45</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Opening angle in degrees. With an opening angle of 45 degrees, barriers "
"situated between 22.5 degrees to the left and 22.5 degrees to the right will"
" be detected."
msgstr "Apertura in gradi: 45 copre da 22,5 gradi a sinistra a 22,5 a destra."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Minimum detection distance. <code>0</code> means that even object that are "
"very close to the bot will be detected."
msgstr ""
"Distanza minima: <code>0</code> include anche gli oggetti vicinissimi."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code>5</code>"
msgstr "<code>5</code>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Maximum detection range. Any barrier situated beyond <code>5</code> meters "
"will not be detected."
msgstr "Distanza massima: esclude le barriere oltre <code>5</code> metri."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To take another example, <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Barrier, 90, 45, 0, "
"5);<n/> will direct the radar 90 degrees to the left, in order to test if "
"the way to the left is free."
msgstr ""
"Per esempio <c/><a cbot|radar>radar</a>(Barrier, 90, 45, 0, 5);<n/> orienta "
"il radar di 90 gradi a sinistra e verifica se il passaggio è libero."

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "tlaby1"
msgstr "tlaby1"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "If there is nothing in front, move forward."
msgstr "Se davanti non c’è nulla, avanza."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "If there is nothing on the left side, quarter turn left, move forward."
msgstr "Se a sinistra è libero, gira di un quarto a sinistra e avanza."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If there is nothing on the right side, quarter turn right, move forward."
msgstr "Se a destra è libero, gira di un quarto a destra e avanza."

#. type: Bullet: '1)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First of all declare three <a cbot|var>variables</a> of type <code><a "
"cbot|object>object</a></code>, that we call <code>front</code>, "
"<code>left</code> and <code>right</code>. Variables of this type can contain"
" the description of any object, for example of a barrier found by the radar."
msgstr ""
"Dichiara tre <a cbot|var>variabili</a> <code><a "
"cbot|object>object</a></code>: <code>front</code>, <code>left</code> e "
"<code>right</code>. Possono descrivere qualsiasi oggetto, come una barriera "
"rilevata dal radar."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "<c/>\tobject   front, left, right;<n/>"
msgstr "<c/>\tobject   front, left, right;<n/>"

#. type: Bullet: '2)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Look for barriers in all three directions, and put the result of the "
"<code>radar</code> instruction into the three variables defined at point 1)."
" If the radar finds nothing, the variable will contain the value <code><a "
"cbot|null>null</a></code>."
msgstr ""
"Cerca barriere nelle tre direzioni e salva il risultato di "
"<code>radar</code> nelle variabili. Se non trova nulla, la variabile vale "
"<code><a cbot|null>null</a></code>."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<c/>\tfront = radar(Barrier,   0, 45, 0, 5);\n"
"\tleft  = radar(Barrier,  90, 45, 0, 5);\n"
"\tright = radar(Barrier, -90, 45, 0, 5);"
msgstr ""
"<c/>\tfront = radar(Barrier,   0, 45, 0, 5);\n"
"\tleft  = radar(Barrier,  90, 45, 0, 5);\n"
"\tright = radar(Barrier, -90, 45, 0, 5);"

#. type: Bullet: '3)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Test if the way is free in front of the bot with the instruction <code><a "
"cbot|if>if</a></code>. If the test is true, the instructions in braces "
"<code>{ }</code> will be executed, otherwise the execution will resume after"
" the closing brace <code>}</code>."
msgstr ""
"Verifica con <code><a cbot|if>if</a></code> se davanti è libero. Se vero, "
"esegue il blocco <code>{ }</code>; altrimenti prosegue dopo la graffa "
"<code>}</code>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction <code>return</code> leaves the program: the job is done."
msgstr "<code>return</code> termina il programma: il compito è concluso."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<c/>if ( front == null )\n"
"{\n"
"\tmove(5);\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"<c/>if ( front == null )\n"
"{\n"
"\tmove(5);\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}"

#. type: Bullet: '4)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Test if it is possible to turn left; if so, turn left with the instruction "
"<code><a cbot|turn>turn</a></code> and move 5m forward."
msgstr ""
"Verifica se puoi girare a sinistra: in tal caso usa <code><a "
"cbot|turn>turn</a></code> e avanza di 5 m."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/help.E.txt:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<c/>if ( left == null )\n"
"{\n"
"\tturn(90);\n"
"\tmove(5);\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"<c/>if ( left == null )\n"
"{\n"
"\tturn(90);\n"
"\tmove(5);\n"
"\treturn;\n"
"}"

#. type: Bullet: '5)'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test if it is possible to turn right."
msgstr "Verifica se puoi girare a destra."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "    ..."
msgstr "    ..."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Attention"
msgstr "Attenzione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The instruction <code>if ( )</code> must never be followed by a <a "
"cbot|term>semicolon</a>."
msgstr ""
"Non inserire mai un <a cbot|term>punto e virgola</a> dopo <code>if ( "
")</code>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<a cbot>Programming</a>, <a cbot|type>types</a> and <a "
"cbot|category>categories</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a cbot>Programmazione</a>, <a cbot|type>tipi</a> e <a "
"cbot|category>categorie</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The program must only take care of one square portion of the labyrinth. You "
"will have to execute it several times in order to arrive at the finishing "
"pad."
msgstr ""
"Il programma affronta un solo quadrato del labirinto: dovrai avviarlo più "
"volte per arrivare."
